OL,3,GNEWSAThefts from woman with Alzheimer's
OL,4,Adevastate family                       
OL,6,FBrinded was sole power of attorney for 
OL,7,FJeczalik, who died in 2024 aged 70,    
OL,8,Feight years after she was diagnosed    
OL,9,Fwith the condition.                    
OL,11,FJeczalik's daughter, Bronia Maxim, said
OL,12,FBrinded "splashed the cash" that       
OL,13,Fbelonged to her mother.                
